{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to blast huge holes to the ground and level every building in sight with powerful cannons? If so, hop in to Cannoneer and experience the might of cannons while ploughing thru several missions, campaigns and achievements while having a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if the solo fun runs out, hop in to the trenches with your fellow cannon-toting comrades and multiply the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannoneer includes a total 42 missions spread around 6 different campaigns with fully destructible environment, over 120 achievements, 50 costume combinations, 10 multiplayer levels and 3 different cannons to rain fire on your foes. Cannoneer offers long lasting cartoonish fun for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy one get two! Cannoneer can be played with PC flat or PCVR modes!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3458720?t=1768124857","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3458720?t=1768124857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458720/be6ab9cb7394e951d9e312722997d95a856f757b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768124857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458720/be6ab9cb7394e951d9e312722997d95a856f757b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768124857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to blast huge holes to the ground and level every building in sight with powerful cannons? If so, hop in to Cannoneer and expe